@* What a recorded game's outcome is called wherever one is listed — the games list, the recent
   strip, a game's own heading, the merge dialog's history. Three states, not two: a draft has no
   outcome yet, which is a different thing from having lost.

   A .badge with the dot in front, so it reads as one of the app's status pills rather than as a
   control; the dot is what carries the colour at this size. *@

@if (!IsCompleted)
{
    <span class="badge badge-neutral">
        <ColorDot Size="2xs" Class="bg-ink-400"/>Draft
    </span>
}
else if (Win == true)
{
    <span class="badge badge-success">
        <ColorDot Size="2xs" Class="bg-accent-600"/>Victory
    </span>
}
else
{
    <span class="badge badge-danger">
        <ColorDot Size="2xs" Class="bg-red-500"/>Defeat
    </span>
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public bool IsCompleted { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public bool? Win { get; set; }
}
